WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.740
Did Bill Skarsgard creep you out?

00:00:01.740 --> 00:00:03.010
Does he creep you out on the set

00:00:03.010 --> 00:00:04.550
when he's playing Pennywise?

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.698
Well, I'm really tough,
so I was unprepared,

00:00:07.698 --> 00:00:09.910
'cause I thought I could
kinda handle anything,

00:00:09.910 --> 00:00:12.610
and then we were at the table read,

00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:13.980
and he was sitting where you are,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:16.290
actually, this was the same configuration,

00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:17.900
and we're reading, and
then all of a sudden,

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:20.020
everyone's normal,
everyone's acting normal

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:22.670
and not weird, and then all of a sudden,

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:25.460
Bill starts saying his character,

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:27.710
and he just turned to me,

00:00:27.710 --> 00:00:30.250
and screamed in my face, "Boo!"

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:31.939
You know, like that weird voice he gets?

00:00:31.939 --> 00:00:32.772
Yeah.

00:00:32.772 --> 00:00:36.044
And I yelled like I was six years old.

00:00:36.044 --> 00:00:37.020
(crowd laughing)

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:38.790
In front of everyone, in front of

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.960
all the executives at Warner Brothers,

00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:42.710
and it was so embarrassing.

00:00:42.710 --> 00:00:44.210
They all went like this, "Yes!"

00:00:44.210 --> 00:00:45.152
Yeah!

00:00:45.152 --> 00:00:45.985
(crowd laughs)

00:00:45.985 --> 00:00:46.818
He's still got it!

00:00:46.818 --> 00:00:48.277
We shall profit from this!

00:00:48.277 --> 00:00:49.460
(laughter)

00:00:49.460 --> 00:00:51.250
We still have our Pennywise!

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:54.130
(laughter)

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.400
Pennywise still has it!

00:00:55.400 --> 00:00:56.233
Yes!

00:00:56.233 --> 00:00:57.066
(laughter)

00:00:57.066 --> 00:00:57.946
Tell the others to go home!

00:00:57.946 --> 00:00:59.060
(laughter)

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.910
They had nine replacements lined up, yeah.

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:01.880
Aw, damn!

00:01:01.880 --> 00:01:06.720
James were you creeped
out by his performance?

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.807
Or did he enter your dreams
after making this movie?

00:01:09.807 --> 00:01:10.640
(laughter)

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:12.617
I'm just generally creeped out by clowns

00:01:12.617 --> 00:01:14.230
but I read the book when I was a kid

00:01:14.230 --> 00:01:16.290
and it didn't scare me, I seem to remember

00:01:16.290 --> 00:01:18.710
but as an adult reading it again,

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:21.137
I definitely had Pennywise in my thoughts

00:01:21.137 --> 00:01:23.150
and I definitely had Bell in my thoughts.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.810
I remember one dream that I had

00:01:24.810 --> 00:01:27.310
where I was lying on my side in bed

00:01:27.310 --> 00:01:29.450
and he was behind me stroking my back.

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:30.410
Oh!

00:01:30.410 --> 00:01:31.243
(crowd laughs)

00:01:31.243 --> 00:01:33.955
And he was saying hey, baby wake up.

00:01:33.955 --> 00:01:35.180
(crowd laughs)

00:01:35.180 --> 00:01:36.355
but I guess it was like,

00:01:36.355 --> 00:01:37.835
hey, bay be wake up, whoo.

00:01:37.835 --> 00:01:39.340
(crowd laughs)

00:01:39.340 --> 00:01:42.166
Is it possible that,
that was Bill Skargard?

00:01:42.166 --> 00:01:43.560
(crowd and cast laughs)

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:44.470
Maybe, but I.

00:01:44.470 --> 00:01:47.190
He's done that to me and yeah.

00:01:47.190 --> 00:01:48.200
How'd you get into my summer home?

00:01:48.200 --> 00:01:49.740
You just have to pretend to be asleep.

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:50.573
(Conan laughs)

00:01:50.573 --> 00:01:52.343
Which we've all done.

